                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a very cute and charming game, until it ISN'T! \r\n\r\nIt will pull you in as a children's block-pushing puzzle game that is very light-hearted and then BAM! The ending is such a 180 surprise twist!\r\n\r\nA few glitches were found here and there, and one that made me hard-reset but that can be overlooked.\r\n\r\n\r\n7/10",
